# See https://help.github.com/articles/ignoring-files/ for more about ignoring files.

.DS_Store

/.ai/local.json
# Depth-independent: a domain's `codexPaths` can plant AGENTS.md at any depth, and an
# unignored one would otherwise become committable. The vendored skills' own AGENTS.md
# files are committed source, so they are negated back in below.
AGENTS.md
!/.ai/skills/vendor/**/AGENTS.md
/CLAUDE.md
/.github/copilot-instructions.md
/.github/instructions/
/.github/agents/
/.github/prompts/
/.github/skills/
/.claude/rules/
/.claude/agents/
/.claude/commands/
/.claude/skills/
/.cursor/rules/
/.cursor/agents/
/.cursor/skills/
/.codex/agents/
/.agents/skills/
